Prebuilt tools (statically linked)
==================================

Host-side tools used during the build.

qemu-*-static: Qemu user-mode emulators, used to run target binaries
(e.g. for cross-rootfs chroot) on an x86_64 host. Extracted from
qemu-user-static_8.0.3+dfsg-4_amd64.deb

ldconfig: Used to generate the target's dynamic linker cache. Based on
Yocto's ldconfig-native_2.12.1, statically linked with:
gcc ldconfig.c -std=gnu99 chroot_canon.c xmalloc.c xstrdup.c cache.c readlib.c -I. -o ldconfig -static
